#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "TLS Expiry Critical (days)"
msgstr "ከባድ የTLS ጊዜ ማብቂያ (ቀናት)"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Days before TLS certificate expiry triggering critical status."
msgstr "የTLS ሰርተፍኬት ጊዜ ከማብቃቱ በፊት ከባድ ሁኔታን የሚቀሰቅሱ ቀናት።"

